  "claims": [
    "Associativity of the actual forkAfter distribution paths is derived for arbitrary opaque typed f, g, p and q from the two retained distribution/projection diagrams, categorical naturality and the pentagon.",
    "Distribution is natural in both arbitrary output argument proof tracks and in an arbitrary shared-prefix proof track, including inverses and composites. Both duplicated occurrences use the same prefix track.",
    "An explicit derived pasting rule combines the two supplied child substitution comparisons into a product-output comparison. It is not a new generator and assumes no unconditional arbitrary-path comparison.",
    "For either side of every typed parent pair layout, composing the actual liftLeft/liftRight of an arbitrary child layout with the actual seqNormal is compared to the inverse associator, the actual parent projection beta step, child seqNormal and a recursively constructed zero-step endpoint correction.",
    "The mapped substitution layout equals the selected child substitution layout; the recursive correction has stepCount exactly zero for arbitrary outputs including products and terminal outputs.",
    "For every typed Layout, precomposing the actual identityNormal output path by reify(layout), then the actual seqNormal(layout, universal output), is compared to rightId(reify(layout)) followed by a recursively constructed zero-step correction.",
    "The actual substituted layout equals the original by map_universal. The right-unit comparison constructs all projected and recursive child faces internally and is also exported using the public normalizeCell(identity output).",
    "No normalization root or new basic higher diagram is added; the retained pure schematic tag count remains Fin 31. Common proof-suffix cancellation and reconstruction concern syntactic higher cells, not wire projection cancellation or equality of probability marginals.",
    "The right-unit comparison embeds in the retained MAC higher presentation with empty intrinsic support. The reused sampled nonlinear layout selects the left input twice, ignores the right input and has a terminal output. Its contextual support is exactly the singleton stage.",
    "Condition reuse and rechecking imply equality of the repaired joint laws in one updated checked model, retaining the correlated past, original state and input. No independent resampling of a copied value is assumed."
  ],
