    "correction_rewrite_leaves": 0
  },
  "limits": [
    "This establishes the RIGHT unit and projected-layout composition. The left unit was established in the prior frozen stage. General substitution associativity is not yet proved.",
    "Higher idempotence for the actual normalizeCell path of reified routes and the unchanged full canonical tensor square remain unconstructed. This result does not re-normalize reify(layout).",
    "The complete finite higher basis and arbitrary branching coverage for the entire eighteen-root/mixed catalogue remain open.",
    "One displayed rightId root and zero correction leaves do not measure full higher certificate bytes, layout/context payloads or checker time. No fair total-cost compression advantage is established.",
    "No new code-changing security reduction, loss/time/resource bound or full continuing physical oracle/keygen execution is supplied. Unregistered NativeConfiguredMAC integration remains excluded.",
    "Mathematical novelty remains unconfirmed. Generic categorical unit, naturality and coherence principles are not claimed as new abstract results. No new external primary-source reading or independent review occurred."
  ],
